Entries for the Vermont QSO Party used by in-state (Vermont) stations
The 14 Vermont counties (each its own multiplier), the 50 states with DC counted as Maryland, and the 13 Canadian provinces and territories.
DXCC countries other than the USA, Canada, Hawaii and Alaska are the class's DX multiplier, not entries here.
The county file comes FIRST, so a county code wins over any state or province alias spelled the same.
DC is mapped to Md before S50.DOM (the rules: DC is counted as MD).
NF and LB are read as NL (the last line); the rules list NL.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.
https://www.ranv.org/vtqso.html

INCLUDE FILE vermont_cty.dom
Dc > Md = DC
INCLUDE FILE s50.dom
INCLUDE FILE p13.dom
Nl = NF,LB
